# Tags web feed — dev notes

## Current goal

Create a clean foundation for the Tags web feed.

## Branch

`levi-web-foundation`

## Build order

1. Architecture and layout first
2. Placeholder data and media until real assets are available

## Out of scope (for now)

- AI integration
- Authentication
- Database
- Payment logic
- Retailer APIs
- Unnecessary npm packages

## Feed UX

- Vertical navigation
- One outfit ≈ one viewport
- Prefer reusable, small components

## Stack

- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Next.js App Router (existing setup)

## Before opening a PR

Run lint and build.
